@startuml create-expense-activity
' Status: Draft - Reconciliation Incomplete. AI-reconciled; not human reviewed (Principle VII).
' Written source: design.md section 4, contracts/service-contracts.md, DEC-26
title Create Expense\nFR-010 to FR-015, FR-017, FR-020 (conditional draft: OC-1 open)

|Creator|
start
:Choose group;
:Enter amount, date, description;
:Select payer (default: self);
:List participants in order;
:Choose equal or percentage split;
if (Percentage split?) then (yes)
  :Enter a percentage per participant;
else (no)
endif
if (Attach a receipt?) then (yes)
  :Pick JPEG or PNG file;
else (no)
endif
:Submit;

|UI|
:Send raw values through UiTaskRunner;

|ExpenseService|
:PREPARE: check session;
:Parse every field and collect FieldErrors
(amount, date, description, duplicates,
non-creator participant, percentages);
:Read and inspect receipt, if any;
:BEGIN transaction;
if (AUTHORIZE: creator is an active member?) then (no)
  :Roll back;
  |UI|
  :Show generic "not found" message;
  stop
else (yes)
endif
|ExpenseService|
:VALIDATE: add errors for a payer or
participant who is not an active member;
if (Any FieldError?) then (yes)
  :Roll back;
  |UI|
  :Show each error beside its field;
  :Keep all entered data; focus the first error;
  |Creator|
  :Correct and resubmit;
  stop
else (no)
endif
|ExpenseService|
:Allocate shares: floor each to the cent,
then one leftover cent each in listed order;
note right
  Worked example: $100.00 equal among 3
  gives 33.34, 33.33, 33.33.
end note
:Create Expense with status PENDING, version 1;
:Insert expense, ordered shares, and receipt;
:NotificationDispatcher: notify every other
active member, in this transaction;
if (Storage failure?) then (yes)
  :Roll back; nothing is saved;
  |UI|
  :Show generic message; keep the form;
  stop
else (no)
endif
|ExpenseService|
:COMMIT;
|UI|
:Show shares in listed order;
note right
  Balances are unchanged until Approved (FR-020).
end note
stop

@enduml
